{%- comment -%}
  NURVA PERFORMANCE — collection (shop) page section.

  Online Store -> Themes -> Edit code -> Sections -> Add a new section,
  name it  nurva-collection  (Shopify adds the .liquid), paste this in, Save.
  Then open your COLLECTION template (Edit code -> Templates -> collection.json,
  or Customize -> browse to any collection -> Add section) and add Nurva collection.

  Uses the page's own `collection` object automatically — nothing to pick.
  Card badges show 'Buy 1 Get 1 Free' on any product with a compare-at price
  set above its price — set that on a product in Shopify to flag it.
  Styles are scoped under .nurva and cannot affect the rest of your theme.
{%- endcomment -%}

